type: timeline-v
title: Release History

- v1.0: Initial release
  - Shipped MVP feature set after 6-month private beta
- v1.2: Bug fixes and performance improvements
  - Reduced p99 latency by 40% and fixed auth edge cases
- v2.0: Major redesign with new information architecture
  - Complete UI overhaul and restructured navigation model
- v2.5: API v2 with GraphQL and improved pagination
  - Introduced cursor-based pagination and field-level permissions
- v3.0: Enterprise tier with SSO and comprehensive audit logs
  - Added SAML/OIDC support and tamper-evident audit trail
